Build me a system repair tool written in rust, have to work with arch repos 
When the system breaks
It should save all files that were safed to an specific dir in an safe directory so the user can get them back
So then they are safed to the recovery dir
And when the system wont boot it goes to recovery mode and gives options like save files to an external
device reinstall with saved files, repair system, recover files. The recovery dir will also be immutable so a
broken system cant override it
This will of course be made in rust